OL,3,GNEWSAUkraine, AI and hybrid threats in
OL,4,AEurope to dominate EU summits in Dublin
OL,5,
OL,6,FUkraine, AI and hybrid threats across
OL,7,FEurope will dominate key EU meetings in
OL,8,FDublin on Thursday and Friday.
OL,10,FThe talks on AI will be the first such
OL,11,Fdiscussion among EU leaders.
OL,13,FThe Republic of Ireland is chairing the
OL,14,FEU presidency until the end of the year
OL,15,Fand its main showpiece events, the
OL,16,FEuropean Political Community (EPC) and
OL,17,Finformal meeting of the European
OL,18,FCouncil, are taking place this week.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
